signal_radio upgrade patch for pma-voice
Use this only on a pma-voice that already has the earlier signal_radio.patch.
A fresh pma-voice 7.0.1 needs only signal_radio.patch.
Apply from inside the pma-voice folder:
  git apply --ignore-whitespace path/to/signal_radio_upgrade_1.patch
If pma-voice sits inside another git repository, git apply can skip every file and print nothing.
In that case, run it from that repository's root and add --directory=path/to/pma-voice.

